  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報318期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;9--月ê雜誌內容猶原真豐富，lán先tuì〈我看<i>AIDS</i>愛滋ê新仇舊恨〉、〈行讀樂生——漢生病治療史重要ê見證〉兩篇，來看病症久年來tī醫學方面ê進步，kap tsia-ê進步應該ài按怎tshuā領lán行向「因為koh-khah理解，tsiah知影thang互相設想、sio-thīn」ê多元社會？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tshui-sak台語文一直是基金會kap lán tsit本beh倚30歲ê雜誌上重要ê使命，上要緊ê頭一步就是〈火星文m̄-thang用〉，若因為kài濟人看無，就lóng無人beh要意正確ê用字，án-ne是beh kah tang時tsiah看有台文--leh？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">「文字」本底就是頭殼底思想ê自由產物，內容百百款，m̄-koh，關係台語文ê普及kap一致化，tī tsit本雜誌拄出世無偌久ê時，就有一篇〈阮對台灣文字標準化ê看法〉，可見tse有影是講bē了、sueh bē盡，ē-tàng吸引濟濟討論ê議題。台語文ê普及tī「公視台語台」成立了後，lán有看著bē少傳播iah網路媒體，沓沓仔開始tuè leh使用台文正字，tse是lán逐家真歡喜看--著ê轉變。啊若是講著「一致化」，tsit條路tio̍h-ài繼續khuann-khuann仔行，ǹg望逐家繼續kā阮溫暖支持！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh0XoD6HZ57OUUiO5BJ8YyKHm5qEgxrQU4CnPIHGKE2aLPTvogWzKlWwiDAgXrmPTGr91YE3CZ-qzJ4conEH0MglwCnoBffK6N9yWMiOgxahr4JgtDdUG51itOVOyrwh_IXvk7WkI3Ee_1ZFKgpRnGjXkPBsDhlvBz3VdKA8dkfwlcg-ATGJuxpMUN-RQ/s1424/318%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh0XoD6HZ57OUUiO5BJ8YyKHm5qEgxrQU4CnPIHGKE2aLPTvogWzKlWwiDAgXrmPTGr91YE3CZ-qzJ4conEH0MglwCnoBffK6N9yWMiOgxahr4JgtDdUG51itOVOyrwh_IXvk7WkI3Ee_1ZFKgpRnGjXkPBsDhlvBz3VdKA8dkfwlcg-ATGJuxpMUN-RQ/w450-h640/318%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><p></p><div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報318期，2020年9月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">--------------------------------------------</div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">